    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Punish the unholy and satiate your hunger!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >[ Combining old school RPG elements with a visual novel! Branching paths that determine your fated end! Customize your build and set forth into a land of the surreal, in a place you aren't familiar with. Uncover the truth behind your past and others. Be mindful however, no one said they were invincible... ]   </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i><strong>Key Features</strong></i></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A terrifyingly dreamy journey with branching paths</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Diverse options for customization of stats and upgrades</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set in a world of science-fantasy, inspired by weird fiction and pulp magazines</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique question battle system</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Partially voiced with English voice acting!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>An endless\u00a0appetite?</i></p></li></ul>",
